  "content": {
    "id": "p18-q13-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "13",
    "prompt": "Find the whole numbers $a$, $b$ and $c$ if\n$$\\dfrac{37}{13}=2+\\dfrac{1}{a+\\dfrac{1}{b+\\dfrac{1}{c}}}.$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$a=1$, $b=5$, $c=2$.\n\nSubtract each whole-number part and take the reciprocal to reveal the next entry.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\dfrac{1}{a+\\dfrac{1}{b+\\dfrac{1}{c}}}&=\\dfrac{37}{13}-2\\\\\\dfrac{1}{a+\\dfrac{1}{b+\\dfrac{1}{c}}}&=\\dfrac{11}{13}\\\\a+\\dfrac{1}{b+\\dfrac{1}{c}}&=\\dfrac{13}{11}\\\\a+\\dfrac{1}{b+\\dfrac{1}{c}}&=1+\\dfrac{2}{11}\\end{align*}$$\nThus $a=1$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\dfrac{1}{b+\\dfrac{1}{c}}&=\\dfrac{2}{11}\\\\b+\\dfrac{1}{c}&=\\dfrac{11}{2}\\\\b+\\dfrac{1}{c}&=5+\\dfrac{1}{2}\\end{align*}$$\nThus $b=5$ and $c=2$.\n\nCheck:\n$$\\begin{align*}2+\\dfrac{1}{1+\\dfrac{1}{5+\\dfrac{1}{2}}}&=2+\\dfrac{1}{1+\\dfrac{2}{11}}\\\\2+\\dfrac{1}{1+\\dfrac{1}{5+\\dfrac{1}{2}}}&=2+\\dfrac{11}{13}\\\\2+\\dfrac{1}{1+\\dfrac{1}{5+\\dfrac{1}{2}}}&=\\dfrac{37}{13}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 92
  },
